<title>FRANCE: Alcatel signs deal with D.Telekom.</title>
<headline>Alcatel signs deal with D.Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom said it had signed a contract with mobile phone operator Deutsche Telekom MobileNet Gmbh for the period 1997-1998 worth some 100 million marks.</p>
<p>The contract is for the delivery of GSM Base Transceiver Stations, Base Station Controllers and well as Mobile Switching Centers.</p>
